<title>COLOMBIA: Cementos Paz del Rio Q1 net jumps.</title>
<headline>Cementos Paz del Rio Q1 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net profit of Colombian cement maker Cementos Paz del Rio rose sharply over the same period last year, from 631 million pesos to 1.26 billion pesos, the Securities Superintendency said.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for the boost in profitability, but said Paz del Rio's net assets totalled 250.6 billion pesos as of March 31 against 209.4 billion in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
